  "ruleText": "Ins 2604.04 Reference to Policy Form Numbers. All printed advertisements except general invitations to inquire about the details of policies shall carry a reference number for any contract form mentioned in the advertisement.\n\nSource. #9333, eff 12-5-08; ss by #11173, eff 12-5-16",
